==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|de|Skala}}. Further from {{der|ru|la|scāla}}, from {{der|ru|la|scandō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|шкала́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-шкала.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|шкала́}}

# [[scale]] (a graph or instrument depicting a sequence of numbers used to measure quantity or quality)

====Usage notes====
* Not to be confused with [[масштаб#Russian|масштаб]] (a ratio of distances on a map, or figuratively used to mean "scope") or [[весы#Russian|весы]] (a device used to measure the weight of objects or people).

